      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Chaosmancer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chaosmancer/48/1977_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Chaosmancer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Welcome to the forums, most of us are crazy, and watch out for wild puns.&nbsp;The rest you must learn for yourself</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Best crash-course in anything I've heard all year.</p>\n<p>Although if you're not used to the forum lingo, you may want to go&nbsp; <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/sotm-glossary-or-what-on-earth-are-these-people-talking-about-4300\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">here</a> or maybe to the Sentinels Slang page (sorry, not linking that too.) Oh, and one more thing:</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Chaosmancer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chaosmancer/48/1977_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Chaosmancer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Welcome to the forums, <strong><em>all</em></strong> of us are crazy, and <strong><em>embrace the puns. There will be many</em></strong>.&nbsp;The rest you must learn for yourself <b><i>(Or ask Guise).</i></b></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Fixed that for ya.</p>",
